'stem-chateau-de-ferrand|2005':{blend:{CS:11,ME:75,CF:14},src:'chateau-de-ferrand-_millesime-2005-en.pdf',taste:'The wine comes in a deep, purple colour. The nose is powerful with notes of black fruit and spices. The flavour blossoms on the palate with rich, beautifully mellow tannins, leading to a fresh, immensely long finish with all the aromatic freshness. The wine offers an outstanding cellaring potential.',pick:{ALL:'09-20|10-07'},yld:36},
'stem-chateau-de-ferrand|2006':{blend:{CS:7,ME:83,CF:10},src:'chf-fiche-millesime-2006-fr.pdf',taste:'Ferrand 2006 presents itself in a robe with orange glints. Its nose, which gains a great deal from being allowed to open quietly, tends towards notes of sweet spice and stewed fruit such as quince. The attack is soft and its development very well balanced. It is the finish that comes to surprise us, carrying a freshness and a powerful tannic weave for a wine of seventeen years.',pick:{ALL:'09-20|'}},
'stem-chateau-de-ferrand|2007':{blend:{CS:13,ME:76,CF:11},src:'chateau-de-ferrand_millesime-2007-en.pdf',taste:'The colour is intense and enticing. The nose is subtle, with a broad array of red fruit aromas. Fine-grained, silky tannins on the palate. Elegant, smooth and with a great length of flavour, culminating in a crisp, fresh finish. A wine best drunk now.'},
'stem-chateau-de-ferrand|2008':{blend:{CS:11,ME:78,CF:11},press:{'Wine Spectator':'91'},src:'chateau-de-ferrand-millesime-2008-en.pdf',taste:'Intense, deep, berry-coloured robe, and a nose packed with toasted aromas and rich dark fruit. Dense, powerful opening, revealing supple tannins and a beautifully refined finish.',pick:{ALL:'10-10|'}},
'stem-chateau-de-ferrand|2009':{blend:{CS:3,ME:83,CF:14},press:{'James Suckling':'90'},src:'chateau-de-ferrand_millesime-2009-en.pdf',taste:'A deep purple colour with touches of salmon pink shows a certain amount of maturity. Huge delicacy on the nose with intense fruit aromas, some ageing, and a touch of undergrowth. On the palate is where this sunny vintage comes into its own. Huge generosity and a wealth of aromas fill the palate, supported by well-integrated tannins and consistent freshness.',pick:{ALL:'10-01|'}},
'stem-chateau-de-ferrand|2010':{blend:{CS:13,ME:77,CF:10},press:{'James Suckling':'90','Robert Parker':'90-92','Wine Spectator':'89-92'},src:'chateau-de-ferrand_millesime-2010-en.pdf',taste:'Wonderfully deep colour. The nose is powerful and expressive, qualities supplemented on the palate by a lively mineral freshness. The tannins are well-rounded and silky-smooth in the mid-palate, while never losing that precious freshness. Great length of flavour and aromatic power, the hallmarks of a truly superior vintage.',pick:{ALL:'10-06|'}},
'stem-chateau-de-ferrand|2011':{blend:{CS:10,ME:79,CF:11},press:{'Wine Spectator':'90'},src:'chateau-de-ferrand_millesime-2011-en.pdf'},
'stem-chateau-de-ferrand|2012':{blend:{CS:9,ME:77,CF:14},press:{'James Suckling':'90','La Revue du Vin de France':'14-15','Robert Parker':'90-92','Wine Spectator':'87-90'},src:'chateau-de-ferrand-2012-en.pdf',taste:'The nose is intense and spicy with notes of leather, truffle and tobacco leaves, signs of a lovely evolution. On the palate, the tannins are fine and velvety, with a round mid-palate. The finish is delicately woody. This beautiful vintage combines balance and freshness. January 2023 t h e 20 12 VIN TAGE 2012 L.12 a n d t i m e STO O D STILL...'},
'stem-chateau-de-ferrand|2013':{blend:{CS:13,ME:73,CF:14},press:{'James Suckling':'89-90','Wine Spectator':'89'},src:'chateau-de-ferrand_millesime-2013-en.pdf',taste:'Its nose opens up to lovely notes of oak and spices, such as cinnamon and pepper. The wonderful freshness first comes though on the palate, with a touch of extra red fruit in the finish. A wine that would be very enjoyable both now and in the years to come, pairing pleasure with simplicity. November 2023 A VIN TAGE FULL O F FIN ESSE...'},
'stem-chateau-de-ferrand|2014':{blend:{CS:5,ME:82,CF:13},press:{'Decanter':'92-93','James Suckling':'92'},src:'chateau-de-ferrand-millesime-2014-en.pdf',taste:'The colour is deep and intense. The bouquet is complex and ripe with roasted notes. The attack on the palate is fresh with good tannic power and not the slightest hint of aggressiveness. Fruit dominates in mid-palate, with a nice aromatic aftertaste and a charming, long-lasting finish.'},
'stem-chateau-de-ferrand|2015':{blend:{CS:10,ME:79,CF:11},press:{'James Suckling':'94','La Revue du Vin de France':'16.5'},src:'chateau-de-ferrand_millesime-2015-en.pdf',pick:{ALL:'09-29|'}},
'stem-chateau-de-ferrand|2016':{blend:{CS:5,ME:80,CF:15},press:{'Decanter':'91','James Suckling':'95','Jancis Robinson':'16.5','Vinous':'93'},src:'chateau-de-ferrand-fiche-millesime-2016-en.pdf'},
'stem-chateau-de-ferrand|2017':{blend:{CS:7,ME:86,CF:7},press:{'Decanter':'91','Vinous':'92','Wine Spectator':'92'},src:'chateau-de-ferrand-fiche-millesime-2017-en.pdf',pick:{ALL:'09-25|'}},
'stem-chateau-de-ferrand|2018':{blend:{ME:73,CF:27},press:{'Decanter':'92','James Suckling':'95','La Revue du Vin de France':'15.5-16','Wine Spectator':'94','Yves Beck':'94'},src:'chateau-de-ferrand-fiche-millesime-2018-fr.pdf'},
'stem-chateau-de-ferrand|2019':{blend:{ME:73,CF:27},press:{'James Suckling':'95','Yves Beck':'94'},src:'chateau-de-ferrand-fiche-millesime-2019-en.pdf'},
'stem-chateau-de-ferrand|2020':{blend:{CS:1,ME:74,CF:25},press:{'Decanter':'94','James Suckling':'94','Wine Spectator':'92'},src:'chateau-de-ferrand-millesime-2020-en.pdf',taste:'On the palate, it offers beautiful balance and incredible freshness, heralding huge potential. There are also some lovely nuances with floral and red fruit notes. It has a velvety mouthfeel with fresh, silky tannins. Château de Ferrand 2020 is a sophisticated wine with a subtle balance and a beautiful richness of aromas.'},
'stem-chateau-de-ferrand|2021':{blend:{CS:1,ME:64,CF:35},src:'chateau-de-ferrand-2021-en.pdf'},
'stem-chateau-de-ferrand|2022':{blend:{ME:66,CF:34},press:{'Decanter':'92-94','Yves Beck':'92-94'},src:'chateau-de-ferrand-2022-en.pdf',taste:'The nose presents a fine aromatic profile with subtle, elegant notes of fresh fruit. On the palate, the attack is lively and the tannins fresh, fine and smooth. The Cabernet Franc provides lovely tension, with full-bodied, velvety texture. Château de Ferrand 2022 is a dynamic, expressive, and well- balanced wine, showcasing the Ferrand limestone terroir.'},
'stem-chateau-de-pressac|2012':{blend:{CS:12,ME:72,CF:14,MA:2.5},src:'TourdePressac_2012_DVE_Guide_Vins_Mars2016.pdf'},
'stem-chateau-fleur-cardinale|2023':{blend:{CS:9,ME:58,CF:33},yld:15,months:'12-14',src:'Fiche-Technique_Chateau-Fleur-Cardinale-2023.pdf',oak:45},
'stem-chateau-franc-mayne|2000':{alc:13.1,yld:40,months:'18',oak:100,src:'fm_ft_2000-fr.pdf',note:'The potential crop is magnificent and, thanks to a very fine flowering, the bunches are even. Leaf-thinning and green harvesting allow us to obtain the best conditions for ripening. After a magnificent August, it is not until 18 September, when our tannins are ripe, that we pick our sandiest plots at the foot of the slope. With the fine weather holding, we carry on calmly with the slope on 22 September and finish with the limestone plateau on 29 September under a radiant sun.'},
