'bourgeois-chateau-castera|2023':{blend:{CF:8,CS:31,ME:58,PV:3},src:'Chateau-Castera-2023-EN.pdf',alc:14,yld:44,taste:'Château Castera 2023 immediately charms on the nose with fresh blackcurrant aromas and a touch of eucalyptus, brought by the Cabernet Sauvignon. On the palate, the wine is generous from the first sip, supported by supple yet well-present tannins that provide structure and character. This lovely freshness carries through to a long, lively finish. A wine full of energy, charm and personality.'},
