'coutet|2023':{blend:{MU:1,SB:4,SEM:95},src:'2023_Chateau_Coutet_CCFR240411.pdf',months:'18',note:'The winter is very mild, more so even than the year before, despite a colder February. Late pruning allows the restart of the vine\'s cycle to be partly delayed, its budbreak falling between 31 March and 3 April.',pick:{ALL:'09-20|'},taste:'The wine reveals aromas of vine flower and gunflint and roasted notes of botrytis, underlined by a touch of dried fig. Ample and complex, it shows itself generous and has an elegant bitterness and a fine freshness balancing the sweetness perfectly. It carries on delicately on notes of white flowers.',ntl:1,ttl:1},
