'levangile|1981':{alc:13,taste:'An elegant nose with notes of black olives and bay leaves accompanied by a subtle smell of smoke. A very nice sweetness in the mouth with a surprising freshness for the age of this wine.',src:'Chateau-LEvangile-1981.pdf'},
